      "init": {
        "label": "Units by dimensionality (FC A4)",
        "body": "Numbers carry a **physical dimension** and compute with it. A meter ÷ a second **is** a m/s; meters + seconds is a **#UNIT!**. A unit rides **per element** through a list and **per column** through a frame — cancellation is free, mismatch is caught.",
