        "label": "A · dimensional algebra: 5 m ÷ 1 s = 5 m/s",
        "body": "A **Format Controller** gives a value its **unit** — the number becomes a dimensioned quantity. Divide a length by a time and the result reads **m/s** — computed from the dimensions, not a label.",
